. I'm going to buy a paper.\n                but  ©.       to make a shopping list. | need some paper / a piece of paper. (not a paper)\n |        Cc     Be careful with:\n\n                  advice            furniture   hair   information    news    weather   work\n                 These nouns are usually noncount. So you can't say a/an... (-abread, -arradviee-), and they can’t be\n                 plural (-adviees, furnitures, etc.).\n                         Can | talk to you? | need some advice. (not an advice)\n\n                         I'm going to buy some bread. (not a bread)\n                         They've got some nice furniture in their house. (not furnitures)\n                         Lauren has very long hair. (not hairs)\n                         Where can | get some information about hotels in Mexico City? (not informations)\n                         Listen! I’ve got some good news. (not a good news)\n                         It’s nice weather today. (not a nice weather)\n                         “Do you like your job?” “Yes, but it’s hard work” (not a hard work)\n                 We  say a job (but not a work):\n                      ©  I've got a new job. (not a new work)\n\n                 @ count/noncount    Unit65   some and any   Unit 74", "char_count": 3206, "mean_conf": 79.37, "word_count": 374, "words": [{"text": "a/an", "x0": 363, "y0": 369, "x1": 452, "y1": 408, "conf": 92, "bold": false}, {"text": "+", "x0": 469, "y0": 377, "x1": 492, "y1": 401, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "singular", "x0": 507, "y0": 365, "x1": 655, "y1": 413, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "count", "x0": 667, "y0": 369, "x1": 774, "y1": 400, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "nouns", "x0": 787, "y0": 372, "x1": 899, "y1": 398, "conf": 93, "bold": false}, {"text": "(car/apple/shoe,", "x0": 915, "y0": 357, "x1": 1250, "y1": 405, "conf": 92, "bold": false}, {"text": "etc.):", "x0": 1264, "y0": 353, "x1": 1353, "y1": 399, "conf": 82, "bold": false}, {"